Name: web-streams-polyfill
Short Name: web_streams_polyfill
URL: https://github.com/MattiasBuelens/web-streams-polyfill
Version: 4.5.1
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Maintained implementation of WHATWG ReadableStream, WritableStream,
TransformStream, byte/BYOB streams and queuing strategies. Plain V8 main and
Worker contexts use the ponyfill; renderer contexts keep native Blink streams.

Source:
