Local Modifications:
package.json and LICENSE are byte-for-byte copies of the npm archive. One final
newline is appended to dist/ponyfill.js for the bootstrap fragment contract;
JavaScript bytes before that newline are unchanged. The bootstrap provides
lexical CommonJS module/exports bindings. No runtime package install or
network access is needed. BYOB buffer ownership relies on V8's ArrayBuffer
transfer primitive, checked before installing this fallback.
